@lang en
IMPORT `pti268-benefits`

-- The three questions a reader asks of a claim, put together from the Parts:
--   1. Is the event covered?           `the claim is covered`
--   2. How much is payable?            `the amount payable on`
--   3. Has the claim been made in time, so that PTI must pay?
--                                       `the amount PTI must pay on`
-- Each limb cites the Part that supplies it. The limbs are ordered so that the facts the
-- encoding can always decide come first: evaluation stops at the first FALSE, and a limb
-- that declines (REFUSE) further down is then never reached (phrasebook entry 11.8).

§ `Putting the Parts together`

§§ `1. Is the event covered?`

-- VI.2, the premium payment warranty: unpaid premium ends cover after the warranty period,
-- without prejudice to liability arising before (fork F26).
GIVEN claim IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the premium payment warranty ended cover before the loss in` claim IF
    CONSIDER `the day cover ends under the warranty, for` (claim's `the contract`) `paid on` (claim's `date the premium was paid in full`)
    WHEN JUST d  THEN claim's `date of the loss` GREATER THAN d
    WHEN NOTHING THEN FALSE

-- Benefit 7's own conditions (the Annex); every other benefit has none beyond Part II.
GIVEN claim IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Annex's conditions are met in` claim IF
    CONSIDER claim's `the outcome`
    WHEN `emergency transport` t THEN `Benefit 7 responds to` t
    OTHERWISE TRUE

@export Decide whether a claim under PTI's comprehensive health care rules through Gras Savoye (Decision 268/QĐ-PTI-BHCN) is covered: eligibility, schedule, period, territory, benefit, waiting periods, exclusions and special cases
GIVEN claim IS A `A claim` @desc the claim: the contract and its schedule, the insured person, the event, the benefit claimed, the outcome and the claim file
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the claim is covered` claim IF
        `insurable under III.1` (claim's `the insured person`)                                -- III.1, defs 39-41
    AND `the benefit claimed is in the schedule, with what it requires, in` claim             -- II, schedule
    AND `the benefit claimed answers the event and outcome in` claim                         -- II
    AND `the claim is within the time of cover` claim                                        -- III.3, III.6
    AND NOT `the premium payment warranty ended cover before the loss in` claim              -- VI.2
    AND NOT `fraud bars` claim                                                               -- III.10
    AND NOT `III.8 bars a condition that existed before cover in` claim                      -- III.8, def 58
    AND NOT `a general exclusion applies to` claim                                           -- IV
    AND `within the territory` (claim's `the contract`) (claim's `the event`)                -- def 43
    AND `the Annex's conditions are met in` claim                                            -- Annex
    AND NOT `the special cases clause bars` claim                                            -- III.12
    AND NOT `a waiting period bars` claim                                                    -- III.8

§§ `2. How much is payable?`

-- The amount the benefit claimed pays, by benefit. For Benefits 3 and 4 a maternity event
-- in the waiting period of a contract of more than 50 employees is paid in proportion
-- (III.8).
GIVEN claim IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount the benefit pays in` claim MEANS
    CONSIDER claim's `the benefit claimed`
    WHEN `Benefit 1` THEN `the amount Benefit 1 pays in` claim
    WHEN `Benefit 2` THEN `the medical costs Benefit 2 pays in` claim
    WHEN `Benefit 3` THEN `the amount Benefit 3 pays in` claim TIMES `the share paid under the maternity proviso in` claim
    WHEN `Benefit 4` THEN `the medical costs Benefit 4 pays in` claim TIMES `the share paid under the maternity proviso in` claim
    WHEN `Benefit 5` THEN `the amount Benefit 5 pays in` claim
    WHEN `Benefit 6` THEN `the medical costs Benefit 6 pays in` claim
    WHEN `Benefit 7` THEN
        CONSIDER claim's `the outcome`
        WHEN `emergency transport` t THEN `the transport cost Benefit 7 pays, in VND, under` (claim's `the contract`) `for` t
        OTHERWISE 0

@export The amount payable, in VND, on a claim under PTI's comprehensive health care rules through Gras Savoye: 0 where the claim is not covered
GIVEN claim IS A `A claim` @desc the claim: the contract and its schedule, the insured person, the event, the benefit claimed, the outcome and the claim file
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount payable on` claim MEANS
    IF   `the claim is covered` claim
    THEN `the amount the benefit pays in` claim
    ELSE 0

§§ `3. Has the claim been made in time?`

-- Part VII: a file outside the network that is late is refused (save force majeure); an
-- accident not notified in writing within 120 days is refused; accident documents sent
-- after 12 months are refused in part or in whole, by an amount the document does not state.
-- Fork F49: all three limits sit under the heading for treatment outside the direct
-- billing network; a claim through the network is not held to them.
GIVEN claim IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an accident claim held to Part VII's limits in` claim IF
        `counts as an accident under` (claim's `the contract`) (claim's `the event`)
    AND NOT claim's `the file`'s `through the direct billing network`

@export The amount PTI must pay on a claim, in VND, once Part VII's time limits for the claim file, the accident notice and the accident documents are applied
GIVEN claim IS A `A claim` @desc the claim: the contract and its schedule, the insured person, the event, the benefit claimed, the outcome and the claim file
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the amount PTI must pay on` claim MEANS
    BRANCH IF NOT `the claim file is in time in` claim                                    THEN 0
           IF     `an accident claim held to Part VII's limits in` claim
              AND NOT `the accident was notified in time in` claim                           THEN 0
           IF     `an accident claim held to Part VII's limits in` claim
              AND NOT `the accident documents were sent in time in` claim                    THEN
               IF   `the amount payable on` claim EQUALS 0
               THEN 0
               ELSE `late accident documents are refused in part or in whole, and the document does not say how much`
           OTHERWISE `the amount payable on` claim
